invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_cfg.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: the Zig server options leave ch_srv_cfg.ticket_key_previous NULL,
  so a Zig server that changed its ticket key ends every live ticket.
  unit.zig's field-by-field ch_cfg test of the server options objects
  (docs/decisions.md 220).
--- old
    cfg.srv.ticket_key_previous = if (options.ticket_key_previous) |key| key else null;
--- new
    cfg.srv.ticket_key_previous = null;
